<td tEditID="c1r1" style=" background-color:#FFFFFF; color:#000000; bEditID:r3st1; bLabel:main; font-size:12pt; font-family:arial;" aEditID="c1r1" locked="0" >
<![CDATA[<div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 12pt; font-family: arial;"><span style="color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: arial, sans-serif; font-size: small; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">Hi {!Contact.FirstName},</span></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 12pt; font-family: arial;"><br></div><div style=""><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><font color="#000000" style="" face="Arial, sans-serif"><font size="2">More powerful than any words I could ever put into writing, I wanted to share these videos with you- some recorded by our owners talking about our company's culture and investment philosophies, and also some from our clients, talking about their experience working with us.</font></font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><font color="#000000" face="Arial, sans-serif" size="2"><br></font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><font color="#000000" face="Arial, sans-serif" size="2">First,<a href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=d5P7wDuBswQ&amp;index=6&amp;list=PLR9u_WowgmHqvUdXN1sZmzQOJOuIFBEd_&amp;t=192s">&nbsp;<font color="#1155cc">start right here and hear the Memphis Invest story</font></a><a href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=d5P7wDuBswQ&amp;index=6&amp;list=PLR9u_WowgmHqvUdXN1sZmzQOJOuIFBEd_&amp;t=192s" target="_blank" data-saferedirecturl="https://www.google.com/url?hl=en&amp;q=https://www.youtube.com/watch?v%3Dd5P7wDuBswQ%26index%3D6%26list%3DPLR9u_WowgmHqvUdXN1sZmzQOJOuIFBEd_%26t%3D192s&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1507212623896000&amp;usg=AFQjCNHdBK1se5eDmPiSQVaLVhsAWuS0mA" style="color: rgb(17, 85, 204);">&nbsp;</a>told by the Clothier family, owners of Memphis Invest.</font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><font color="#000000" face="Arial, sans-serif" size="2"><br></font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><font color="#000000" face="Arial, sans-serif" size="2">These next few videos answer some of our most frequently asked questions overall:</font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><font color="#000000" face="Arial, sans-serif" size="2"><br></font></div><div style=""><font face="Arial, sans-serif" size="2" style="" color="#3333ff"><a href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=V8lu1aeirHY&amp;index=7&amp;list=PLR9u_WowgmHqvUdXN1sZmzQOJOuIFBEd_" style="">How do I get started?</a></font></div><div style=""><font face="Arial, sans-serif" size="2" style="" color="#3333ff"><a href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=SXfMethkcyE&amp;t=48s">Why do I need to build a portfolio vs. just buying 1 property?</a></font></div><div style=""><font face="Arial, sans-serif" size="2" style="" color="#3333ff"><a href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=vKHIEJcNB_0&amp;t=34s">Why did you choose Memphis, Dallas, Houston, Little Rock, and Oklahoma City as your markets?</a></font></div><div style=""><font face="Arial, sans-serif" size="2" style="" color="#3333ff"><a href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=XCOjFpDkBk0&amp;t=331s" style="">What should I be looking for when selecting the right turnkey partner?</a></font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><font color="#000000" face="Arial, sans-serif" size="2"><br></font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><font color="#000000" face="Arial, sans-serif" size="2">Ok, so you've heard from the owners, but you also REALLY need to hear it from investors that have been with us for several years.</font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><font color="#000000" face="Arial, sans-serif" size="2"><br></font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><font color="#000000" face="Arial, sans-serif" size="2">So start right&nbsp;<font color="#1155cc"><a href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=KVIFV5Ob7BQ&amp;t=28s">here</a></font>&nbsp;and then keep going&nbsp;<font color="#1155cc"><a href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=iDXFJs29D_o&amp;t=85s">right here</a></font>, and if you still need convincing that we are the best in our industry, go ahead and watch<a href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=ol9-pxqJBGc">&nbsp;</a><font color="#1155cc"><a href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=ol9-pxqJBGc">this one</a></font>&nbsp;and<a href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=OgcFDsRjJz0">&nbsp;<font color="#1155cc">that one.</font></a></font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><font color="#000000" face="Arial, sans-serif" size="2"><br></font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><font color="#000000" face="Arial, sans-serif" size="2">This next link is the most important of all. This one puts you on the path. If you feel fairly certain that we are the right fit for you as a company and that you would be a great client for us,&nbsp;<font color="#1155cc"><a href="https://my.timetrade.com/book/CMYYR ">click right here to schedule a call with me and let's get this thing going!</a></font></font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><font color="#000000" face="Arial, sans-serif" size="2"><br></font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><font color="#000000" face="Arial, sans-serif" size="2">Looking forward to talking with you soon.</font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><font color="#000000" face="Arial, sans-serif" size="2"><br></font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><font color="#000000" face="Arial, sans-serif" size="2">Sincerely,</font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><font color="#000000" face="Arial, sans-serif" size="2"><br></font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><font color="#000000" face="Arial, sans-serif" size="2">Ashley&nbsp;</font></div><font face="Arial, sans-serif" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);" size="2"><font color="#000000" style="">--&nbsp;</font><br></font><div class="m_66494544266427284m_305702433154860616m_-5591879820245908979gmail_signature" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 12pt; font-family: arial;"><div dir="ltr"><div><div dir="ltr"><div><div dir="ltr"><div><div dir="ltr"><div><div dir="ltr"><div><div dir="ltr"><div><div dir="ltr"><div dir="ltr"><div dir="ltr"><div dir="ltr"><div dir="ltr"><div style="font-size: 12.8px;"><div dir="ltr"><div dir="ltr"><div dir="ltr"><div dir="ltr" 